  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-332873\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's sketch the trajectory.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We start at the given point and go along with the flow (slightly downward and to the right) until the trajectory intersects the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"32\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-6955a154ba5a5cf49c68d70088363cd2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/6955a154ba5a5cf49c68d70088363cd2\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li><p>Next, the flow continues to the right and gradually turns upward.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-79e3cda4671738972e41600ddb13b4e1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/79e3cda4671738972e41600ddb13b4e1\"></div>\n</li>\n<li><p>After that, the trajectory keeps going to the right and slightly upward to infinity.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-7aa2761bb28be9d45007943200f1ee4d\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/7aa2761bb28be9d45007943200f1ee4d\"></div><div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-332873-a-3\"></div></div>",
